# 🤖 AI Email Assistant with n8n, Google Sheets & Gmail

## Overview

An AI-powered email assistant that allows users to manage email tasks through natural-language conversation.

The AI Agent can understand instructions, retrieve updated information from Google Sheets, identify relevant contacts and send emails through Gmail.

## 💼 Business Problem

Many business processes require people to repeatedly:

* Check spreadsheets
* Find contact information
* Write emails
* Send follow-ups
* Switch between multiple applications

This workflow brings those steps together behind a conversational AI interface.

## ⚙️ Workflow Architecture

```text
User Message
     ↓
AI Agent
     ↓
Understand Instruction
     ↓
Google Sheets
     ↓
Retrieve Updated Data
     ↓
LLM Processing
     ↓
Prepare Email
     ↓
Gmail
     ↓
Send Email
```

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* n8n
* AI Agent
* LLM
* Google Sheets
* Gmail
* Conversational interface

## 🔑 Key Steps

1. Receive a user instruction
2. Pass the message to the AI Agent
3. Interpret the requested action
4. Read the latest Google Sheets data
5. Identify the required contact information
6. Generate the appropriate email
7. Send the email through Gmail
8. Return the result to the user

